essage.content).reason }}</span>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- LinkedIn Post Preview -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 36px 16px;\">\n              <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.2);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#60a5fa;\">🔵 LINKEDIN POST</p>\n                <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-wrap;\">{{ JSON.parse($('Gemini Generate Posts1').item.json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text).linkedin }}</p>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Discord Post Preview -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 36px 28px;\">\n              <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(124,58,237,0.2);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a78bfa;\">🟣 DISCORD POST</p>\n                <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.7;\">{{ JSON.parse($('Gemini Generate Posts1').item.json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text).discord }}</p>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 36px 32px;\">\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"48%\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding-right:8px;\">\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost:5678/webhook-test/approval-response?action=approve&blog_id={{ $('FastAPI Store Blog1').item.json.blog_id }}&draft_id={{ $('Save Draft to SQLite1').item.json.draft_id }}\"\n                       style=\"display:block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a34a,#15803d);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n                      ✅ APPROVE & PUBLISH\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td width=\"48%\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding-left:8px;\">\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost:5678/webhook-test/approval-response?action=reject&blog_id={{ $('FastAPI Store Blog1').item.json.blog_id }}&draft_id={{ $('Save Draft to SQLite1').item.json.draft_id }}\"\n                       style=\"display:block;background:rgba(220,38,38,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,0.4);color:#f87171;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n                      ❌ REJECT\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:20px 36px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;color:#334155;\">⚡ AI-Powered Multimodal Campaign Automation</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#1e293b;\">Gemini 2.0 Flash · Groq Vision · ChromaDB RAG</p>\n                  </td>\n                  <td align=\"right\">\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;color:#334155;\">Draft ID: {{ $('Save Draft to SQLite1').item.json.draft_id }}</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#1e293b;\">{{ new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', {year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric'}) }}</p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n      